# A boundary list that resolves

## The boundaries, and what bounds each one

- The output of a child process, read by something that answers rather than
  throwing. Bounded by `WhisperOutputReader`. Hostile case in
  `WhisperOutputReaderTests`.
- The list itself, whose endings are resolved rather than believed. Bounded by
  `Plugin`. Hostile case in `UntrustedInputTests`.

## Something after it

So the reader has a heading to stop at.
